graph TD
    accTitle: Criteria-Based Record Extraction Workflow
    accDescr: Flowchart showing extract_records_by_criteria fetching subjects, visits, and records in parallel to apply filters and return matching records
    A[extract_records_by_criteria] --> B[subjects.list]
    A --> C[visits.list]
    A --> D[records.list]
    B --> E{subject keys}
    C --> F{visit ids}
    D --> G{apply filters}
    E --> G
    F --> G
    G --> H[return records]
